---
interface Props {
  appUrl: string;
}

const { appUrl } = Astro.props;
const mentorUrl = `${appUrl}/mentor`;

const readings = [
  { name: 'Cambio', detail: 'Qué se está moviendo' },
  { name: 'Perspectiva', detail: 'Desde dónde lo miras' },
  { name: 'Ciclo', detail: 'Qué vuelve a aparecer' },
  { name: 'Oposición', detail: 'Qué fuerzas compiten' },
  { name: 'Integración', detail: 'Qué puede convivir' },
  { name: 'Equilibrio', detail: 'Qué necesita ajuste' },
];
---

<section
  class="section center-preview"
  id="mi-centro"
  aria-labelledby="center-preview-title"
  data-track-section="mi_centro"
>
  <div class="container center-shell">
    <div class="center-copy">
      <span class="section-kicker">Mi centro · Lectura de 30 días</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="center-preview-title">
        Vuelve a ver el hilo común entre lo que te importa y lo que estás viviendo.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Mi centro relaciona tu misión, tus Lentes de misión y los registros que decides guardar durante los últimos 30 días, incluso cuando utilizas distintos perfiles de Mentor.
      </p>

      <ul class="center-principles" aria-label="Qué aporta Mi centro">
        <li>
          <span class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Una lectura transversal</strong>
            <p>Reúne señales que antes vivían separadas para que puedas revisarlas en contexto.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>Evidencias que puedes abrir</strong>
            <p>Cada lectura muestra de qué registros parte, sin convertir una interpretación en una verdad absoluta.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="principle-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div>
            <strong>La decisión sigue siendo tuya</strong>
            <p>Corrige, añade tus notas o convierte la reflexión final en una propuesta que todavía tendrás que confirmar.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="center-actions">
        <a
          class="button button--ghost center-action"
          href={mentorUrl}
          data-app-link
          data-track="center_cta_clicked"
          data-track-location="center_preview"
        >
          Ir a Mi centro
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
            <path d="M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <span>Disponible en Virtus web · Lo encontrarás como una pestaña dentro del Mentor.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="center-product" aria-labelledby="center-product-caption">
      <div class="center-window">
        <div class="center-window__bar">
          <div>
            <span class="center-window__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <strong>Mi centro</strong>
          </div>
          <span>Últimos 30 días</span>
        </div>

        <div class="declared-center">
          <span>Tu centro declarado</span>
          <p>Construir con ambición sin dejar fuera a las personas y el descanso que quiero proteger.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="reading-heading">
          <div>
            <span>Seis lecturas conectadas</span>
            <strong>Lo que aparece al mirar el periodo en conjunto</strong>
          </div>
          <span class="reading-status">Lectura generada</span>
        </div>

        <div class="reading-grid">
          {readings.map((reading, index) => (
            <div class:list={['reading-card', index === 4 && 'reading-card--featured']}>
              <span class="reading-index">0{index + 1}</span>
              <strong>{reading.name}</strong>
              <small>{reading.detail}</small>
              {index === 4 && (
                <div class="evidence-line">
                  <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  Basado en Diario · Mentor · Check-in
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="final-reading">
          <div>
            <span>Reflexión final</span>
            <p>¿Qué ritmo te permite seguir construyendo sin dejar fuera aquello que querías proteger?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="final-reading__actions" aria-label="Salidas posibles desde la reflexión">
            <span>Tarea</span>
            <span>Misión</span>
            <span>Rutina</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="center-disclaimer">
          Lectura reflexiva basada en registros elegidos por ti. No es un diagnóstico ni una valoración objetiva.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figcaption id="center-product-caption">Ejemplo ilustrativo de Mi centro · datos ficticios</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .center-preview {
    isolation: isolate;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 4% 18%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--flow) 10%, transparent), transparent 30rem),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 96% 88%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 15%, transparent), transparent 32rem),
      var(--surface);
  }

  .center-preview::before,
  .center-preview::after {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-blob);
    content: '';
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .center-preview::before {
    top: 4rem;
    right: -9rem;
    width: 24rem;
    height: 18rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--flow) 7%, transparent);
    transform: rotate(12deg);
  }

  .center-preview::after {
    bottom: 3rem;
    left: -10rem;
    width: 27rem;
    height: 20rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 8%, transparent);
    transform: rotate(-9deg);
  }

  .center-shell {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .center-copy {
    max-width: 43rem;
  }

  .center-copy .section-title {
    max-width: 17ch;
  }

  .center-copy .section-lede {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .center-principles {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .center-principles li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .principle-mark {
    position: relative;
    width: 1.15rem;
    height: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 0.18rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 38%, var(--line));
    border-radius: 68% 32% 57% 43% / 42% 62% 38% 58%;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 18%, var(--surface));
  }

  .principle-mark::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.28rem;
    left: 0.34rem;
    width: 0.38rem;
    height: 0.58rem;
    border: solid var(--root);
    border-width: 0 1.5px 1.5px 0;
    content: '';
    transform: rotate(42deg);
  }

  .center-principles strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.14rem;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 720;
  }

  .center-principles p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .center-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  .center-action {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 35%, var(--line));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, var(--root-soft));
    color: var(--root-deep);
  }

  .center-action:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 62%, var(--line));
  }

  .center-actions > span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .center-product {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .center-product::before {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 4% -3% -4% 4%;
    border-radius: 40% 60% 55% 45% / 52% 42% 58% 48%;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--flow) 13%, transparent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 15%, transparent));
    content: '';
    filter: blur(14px);
  }

  .center-window {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 22%, var(--line));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3.5vw, 1.7rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 95%, var(--flow) 5%), color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 94%, var(--root) 6%));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .center-window::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: -5rem;
    bottom: -5rem;
    width: 14rem;
    height: 12rem;
    border-radius: 61% 39% 48% 52% / 42% 62% 38% 58%;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 10%, transparent);
    content: '';
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .center-window__bar {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 680;
  }

  .center-window__bar > div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .center-window__bar strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 760;
  }

  .center-window__mark {
    width: 0.72rem;
    height: 0.72rem;
    border-radius: 65% 35% 58% 42% / 43% 61% 39% 57%;
    background: var(--gradient-brand);
  }

  .declared-center {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--flow) 19%, var(--line));
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1rem 1.05rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 82%, var(--flow-soft));
  }

  .declared-center > span,
  .reading-heading span,
  .final-reading > div > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    color: var(--flow-deep);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 780;
  }

  .declared-center p {
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 0.9rem + 0.38vw, 1.2rem);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .reading-heading {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .reading-heading strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 680;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .reading-heading .reading-status {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 19%, var(--surface));
    color: var(--root-deep);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .reading-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .reading-card {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 5rem;
    align-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 89%, transparent);
  }

  .reading-index {
    color: var(--root);
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-weight: 780;
  }

  .reading-card > strong {
    margin-top: 0.16rem;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .reading-card > small {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.57rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .reading-card--featured {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 31%, var(--line));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 79%, var(--root-soft));
  }

  .evidence-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-top: 0.42rem;
    color: var(--root-deep);
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .evidence-line > span {
    width: 0.38rem;
    height: 0.38rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--root);
  }

  .final-reading {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sage) 34%, var(--line));
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 82%, var(--sage-soft));
  }

  .final-reading p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 620;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .final-reading__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .final-reading__actions span {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--root) 24%, var(--line));
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.26rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--root-deep);
    font-size: 0.52rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .center-disclaimer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.54rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .center-product figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  @media (min-width: 30rem) {
    .reading-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 42rem) {
    .center-actions {
      align-items: center;
      flex-direction: row;
    }

    .reading-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .final-reading {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .final-reading__actions {
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .center-shell {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.78fr) minmax(34rem, 1.22fr);
    }

    .center-product {
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }
</style>
